  "descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "The DHFT Symbols component is part of the DHFT Formal Repository. It houses symbolic notation, mathematical expressions, governing inequalities, formal relations, and equation-facing records associated with Dimensional Human Field Theory (DHFT), the Structural Identification Method (SIM), and Load\u2013Capacity\u2013Boundary Mechanics (LCB).\n\nThis component supports notation consistency, formal clarity, and source-continuity across DHFT records. It does not define new variables, create additional mechanics, authorize implementation, or establish a separate mathematical framework. All valid formal expressions remain governed by the DHFT source architecture and reduce to Load (L), Capacity (C), and Boundary (B).",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract"
    }
  ],
